사항</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">？ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">신청서에 성명, 주소, 연락처 등 기재 요구사항을 기재하지 않거나 지정양식 이외의 서식으로 제출된 작품은 심사에서 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">？ 마감기한 이후 지연도착 및 작품파손에 따른 심사불이익에 대해서는 책임지지 않음</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">？ 심</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">사결과에 따라 당선작 전부 또는 일부를 선정하지 않을 수 있음</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">？ 1인당 1작품 이상 제출은 가능하나, 중복 시상은 하지 않음</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID